# Red P1 R4 result: F1 route pins scoped per handler with mutation proof

HEAD at start was e0d5762, which equals the role base SHA. The phase base SHA da1e7bb resolves. Work is on branch fix/board-focus-reasons. Task 1.3 stays [~].

